  "question": {
    "text": "If the circles <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>K</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>K</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, intersect at the points P and Q, then the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, passes through <math><mi>P</mi></math> and <math><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo></math> for:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "exactly two values of <math><mi>K</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "no value of <math><mi>K</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
